OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly although rather cloudy,
OL,6,Fsome brighter spells breaking through
OL,7,Fat times. Chance of a shower across
OL,8,Fthe east. Brisk southeasterly wind
OL,9,Falong the east coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,13,Fand rather cloudy, some clear periods
OL,14,Fin the north. Fresh southeasterly wind.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FA dry day although still with
OL,17,Fa fair amount of cloud at times, best
OL,18,Fof the brightness in the northwest.
OL,19,FFresh southeasterly wind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
